icle is undergoing forced harmonic motion with damping?" :question/worked-solution "The general equation of forced harmonic motion with damping is\n\n$$\n{y}^{″}+b{y}^{′}+{\\omega }^{2}y=f(t).\n$$\n\nWe can see that the only equation that represents forced harmonic motion with damping is\n\n$$\n{y}^{″}+2{y}^{′}+4y=\\frac{2}{{t}^{2}}.\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "q-94229/selection/027d3b223ea48d942646cc138cc5617ec71e83e7e22cb6dca734e403efb45c3b" :answer/id #uuid "e49a0fa6-92d5-5aa0-9243-63a7f315543b" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{y}^{″}+3{y}^{′}+8y=0" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-94229/selection/e1980b9aacd96dc4c8f4f27b1698d762a6b8a1e8c4a14ab0260ab895119d943e" :answer/id #uuid "9c2cdfde-48f3-58b2-ba6d-e57ec8d684b6" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{y}^{″}+4y=0" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-94229/selection/b56ff0af28c91170985f40e83610ffb50a4a4fd62081f5c626e956e8cb381f25" :answer/id #uuid "a9f6d2ba-a31b-53a7-8114-c1a19d09a90a" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{y}^{″}+11y=3" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-94229/selection/785c0741f1320f7a66e6582b84d823b90917d11683a5e9188550548cadfd4afe" :answer/id #uuid "5a7be8b3-b5bb-5491-bffa-911625bca538" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{y}^{″}-2y={t}^{3}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-94229/selection/1a6d35528b934554654c2dc70fa6641af3539051ccb76a98d5bc8b6152955492" :answer/id #uuid "a29c46c5-c1e6-506c-93f5-4ba726a517eb" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{y}^{″}+7{y}^{′}+4y=1-3t" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-94229/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "2f11057f-5505-58c7-bc01-b9b26002ff85" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-94229/selection/b56ff0af28c91170985f40e83610ffb50a4a4fd62081f5c626e956e8cb381f25" :answer-field/choices ["q-94229/selection/027d3b223ea48d942646cc138cc5617ec71e83